# Pairs with TypeOK in ReplicationReBootstrap. A leaf clock that jumps by the number
# of writes already authored takes an HLC outside the declared domain.
MODULE: TypeOkReBootstrapHlcRunaway
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: stamps a write with an HLC beyond the declared domain, so TypeOK fires
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
    /\ LET w == [o |-> o, h |-> h, del |-> d]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the stamped HLC runs ahead of the chosen one.
    /\ LET w == [o |-> o, h |-> h + Cardinality(authored), del |-> d]
--- END
